* When talking to one of the guards near the ogre cage, they reveal that the ogres have been terrorising the area, and that they've eaten four children this week alone, which is why the ogres are being used for target practice as punishment.{{CiteNPC|npc=Guard (Combat Training Camp)|quote=Well hello brave warrior. These ogres have been terrorising the area, they've eaten four children this week alone. So we decided to use them for target practice. A fair punishment.|loc=|notes=|name=}}

